{"id": "1801806", "name": "נגזרת של אינטגרל מ a עד x", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "ff", "params": ["t"], "body": "funcs[ii]"}, {"name": "gg", "params": ["t"], "body": "funcs[jj]"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>אנו נשתמש בסימון המקובל עבור הנגזרת:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{d}{dx} f(x)\\equiv f'(x).\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את שתי הנגזרות הבאות (<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> שרירותי כך שהאינטגרל בין <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> ל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> מוגדר):</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\frac{d}{dx} \\displaystyle{\\int_a^x {{CT:0}}} \\, dt = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\frac{d}{dx}\\displaystyle{ \\int_x^a {{CT:1}}} \\, dt = \\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הזינו תשובתכם עם משתנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>המשפט היסודי של החדו\"א אומר שאם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)\\)</span> רציפה בקטע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( [a,b]\\)</span> אז הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F(x) := \\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt \\]</p><p>היא גזירה בקטע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( (a,b), \\)</span> ונגזרתה היא:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F'(x) = f(x). \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>לכן,</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\frac{d}{dx} \\int_a^x {{CT:0}} \\, dt = {{CT:2}},\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\frac{d}{dx} \\int_x^a {{CT:1}} \\, dt = \\frac{d}{dx} \\left(-\\int_a^x {{CT:1}} \\, dt \\right) = {{CT:3}}.\\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:Result]]", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה. יפה מאוד.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">תשובתך נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "radcan(ans1)", "tans": "radcan(fDeriv)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "gDeriv", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["fDeriv", "funcs", "gDeriv", "ii", "jj"], "nvariants": 42}